<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->The kiiro scouts have spotted a pirate outpost near [kiiro_settlement_label]! While the exact intentions of the pirates are unknown, the kiiros feels threatened, and the residents of [kiiro_settlement_label] are in a state of anxiety.\n\nSeveral guerrilla teams have gathered near [kiiro_settlement_label] and are discussing an attack plan. However, due to the significant strength of the pirate outpost, they hope to receive assistance from allies.\n\nThe reinforced pirate outpost has been marked on your map. You can send a team to the outpost to fight alongside the kiiro guerrilla teams.\n\nThis is a challenging quest.</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->綺羅族的斥候在[kiiro_settlement_label]附近偵察到了海盜建立的據點！雖然不知道海盜的具體意圖是什麼，但綺羅族還是感受到了威脅，[kiiro_settlement_label]的居民們一時間人心惶惶。\n\n[kiiro_settlement_label]附近已經聚集了數支游擊隊，正在商量進攻計劃。但由於此次海盜建立的據點兵力眾多，非同小可，游擊隊希望能夠得到盟友的援助。\n\n海盜的強化據點已經標註在你的地圖上。你可以派出隊伍前往據點與綺羅族的游擊隊並肩作戰。\n\n這是一個難度較高的任務。</li>
  </Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->Pirates threat</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->海盜威脅</li>
  </Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Pirate outpost destroyed -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>海盜據點被摧毀</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The guerrilla assembled near [kiiro_settlement_label] have successfully destroyed the pirate outpost, albeit at great cost. -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>[kiiro_settlement_label]附近集結的游擊隊在付出了巨大的代價后摧毀了海盜的據點。</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [kiiro_settlement_label] destroyed -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[kiiro_settlement_label]被摧毀</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The assembled pirates launched an attack on [kiiro_settlement_label], and despite the valiant resistance of nearby guerrilla teams and hastily organized militia from [kiiro_settlement_label], the settlement ultimately fell. The remaining guerrilla members sacrificed their lives to protect the residents of [kiiro_settlement_label], allowing them to evacuate their homeland and embark on a long journey. Your relationship with kiiros has decreased by [goodWillRewardAbs]. -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>集結起來的海盜襲擊了[kiiro_settlement_label]，儘管附近的游擊隊和[kiiro_settlement_label]倉促組織的民兵拚死抵抗，但[kiiro_settlement_label]最終還是失陷了。殘存的游擊隊員以生命為代價掩護了[kiiro_settlement_label]的居民們撤離家園，開始了漫長的流浪。與綺羅族的關係下降了[goodWillRewardAbs]。</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [resolvedQuestName] failed -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[resolvedQuestName]失效</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Due to the hostile relationship with the kiiros, [resolvedQuestName] cannot be completed further. -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由於與綺羅族處於敵對關係，[resolvedQuestName]無法繼續完成。</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>